updated_at: "2026-10-29T22:37:33.033Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Cover only-last and other selectors on a multi-test item through CLI and SDK; preserve complete stored evidence and skipped counts; document the full-evidence restore path and measured receipt-token reduction.
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: A selected run emits selected evidence and complete selection/count metadata by default; explicit full reads restore the whole collection without weakening immutable run history.
